# Quotation workflow. Customers: log in as a customer. Companies: log in
# as a member of the company. Amounts are minor units of the request's
# currency (ETB santim): 1400000 = 14,000.00 ETB.

@base = http://localhost:5050
@designId = paste-design-id-here
@requestId = paste-quote-request-id-here
@companyId = paste-company-id-here
@lineId = paste-line-id-here

### ---- customer ----

### Ask every seller in a design for a quote (one request per seller)
POST {{base}}/v1/quote-requests/from-design
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "design_id": "{{designId}}",
  "contact_phone": "+251 911 223344",
  "delivery_address": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "note": "Can you deliver by mid-November?"
}

### Or ask one seller about products picked directly
POST {{base}}/v1/quote-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "product_id": "paste-product-id", "quantity": 4 } ] }

### My requests (filter: ?status=quoted)
GET {{base}}/v1/quote-requests

### One request with lines, charges and totals
GET {{base}}/v1/quote-requests/{{requestId}}

### Accept — send the revision you looked at
POST {{base}}/v1/quote-requests/{{requestId}}/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{ "revision": 1 }

### Reject / cancel
POST {{base}}/v1/quote-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
###
POST {{base}}/v1/quote-requests/{{requestId}}/cancel

### ---- company ----

### Inbox (filter: ?status=pending)
GET {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/quote-requests?status=pending

### Start reviewing
POST {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/quote-requests/{{requestId}}/review

### Send (or revise) the quote: price every line
PUT {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/quote-requests/{{requestId}}/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [ { "line_id": "{{lineId}}", "unit_price_minor": 1400000, "note": "display model discount" } ],
  "charges": [ { "label": "Delivery within Addis", "amount_minor": 250000 } ],
  "valid_until": "2026-11-30",
  "note": "Prices include 15% VAT."
}

### Decline
POST {{base}}/v1/companies/{{companyId}}/quote-requests/{{requestId}}/decline
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Sorry, this model is discontinued." }
